InitializeDistributionTest
├── when hook authorized address is not strategy
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidHook}
├── when hook lacks the before-initialize permission bit
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidHook}
├── when hook is the zero address and the pool is already initialized
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidHook}
├── when bracket schedule is empty
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketCount}
├── when bracket count exceeds the max
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketCount}
├── when a bracket rate is zero
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketRate}
├── when a bracket rate is greater than the max bracket rate
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketRate}
├── when the first bracket lowerThreshold is non-zero
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketThreshold}
├── when a non-last bracket lowerThreshold is zero
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketThreshold}
├── when bracket lowerThresholds are not strictly ascending
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketThreshold}
├── when bracket lowerThresholds are equal
│   └── it reverts with {InvalidBracketThreshold}
├── when a bracket rate is exactly the max bracket rate
│   └── it stores the migration parameters
└── when the bracket schedule is valid
    ├── when poolParameters.tickSpacing is out of bounds
    │   └── it reverts with {InvalidTickSpacing}
    └── when poolParameters.tickSpacing is valid
        ├── when poolParameters.fee is greater than MAX_LP_FEE
        │   └── it reverts with {InvalidFee}
        ├── when poolParameters.fee is the dynamic fee flag without a hook
        │   └── it reverts with {InvalidDynamicFeeHook}
        ├── when poolParameters.fee is the dynamic fee flag with a hook
        │   └── it stores the migration parameters
        └── when poolParameters.fee is valid
            ├── when a position definition recipient is reserved
            │   └── it reverts with {InvalidPositionRecipient}
            └── when the position definition recipient is valid
                ├── when reservedTokenAmountForLP exceeds int128.max
                │   └── it reverts with {InvalidReservedTokenAmountForLP}
                ├── when reservedTokenAmountForLP is zero
                │   └── it reverts with {InvalidReservedTokenAmountForLP}
                ├── when reservedTokenAmountForLP equals totalSupply
                │   └── it reverts with {InvalidReservedTokenAmountForLP}
                └── when reservedTokenAmountForLP is valid
                    ├── when token and currency are the same
                    │   └── it reverts with {InvalidTokenCurrencyPair}
                    ├── when position definitions are empty
                    │   └── it stores the migration parameters
                    ├── when position definition weights exceed 1e7
                    │   └── it reverts with {InvalidAllocationWeights}
                    ├── when a position definition weight is zero
                    │   └── it reverts with {ZeroPositionWeight}
                    ├── when position definition tick bounds are invalid
                    │   └── it reverts with {InvalidTickBounds}
                    ├── when position definition count exceeds max
                    │   └── it reverts with {TooManyPositions}
                    └── when the migrator params are valid
                        ├── when initializer fundsRecipient is not strategy
                        │   └── it reverts with {InvalidFundsRecipient}
                        ├── when initializer tokensRecipient is strategy
                        │   └── it reverts with {InvalidTokensRecipient}
                        ├── when initializer endBlock is GTE migrationBlock
                        │   └── it reverts with {InvalidEndBlock}
                        └── when the initializer is valid
                            ├── it stores the migration parameters
                            └── it emits {InitializerCreated}
